---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { WHATSAPP_URL, KAKAO_URL, EMAIL_URL } from '../consts';
---

<Base
  title="Contact Us — Balli Balli Seoul"
  description="Tell us what's wrong in English on WhatsApp. Send a photo, your address and what happened — we handle the Korean side. First answer is free."
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class="contact">
    <p class="eyebrow">One message is all it takes</p>
    <h1>Tell us what's wrong — in English</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Whatever's broken, blocked or confusing in Korea, describe it in
      English and we handle the Korean side. To get you the fastest, most
      accurate answer, have these three things ready:
    </p>

    <ol class="prep">
      <li>
        <span class="num">1</span>
        <div>
          <strong>A photo of the problem</strong>
          <p>One photo tells us more than ten messages — the lock, the drain, the error screen, whatever it is.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="num">2</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Your address — including building &amp; unit (동/호수)</strong>
          <p>Korean addresses need the building and unit number to dispatch anyone accurately.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="num">3</span>
        <div>
          <strong>What happened, briefly</strong>
          <p>When it started, what you already tried — two sentences is plenty.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <a href={KAKAO_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cta-btn kakao">KakaoTalk</a>
      <a href={WHATSAPP_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cta-btn">💬 WhatsApp</a>
      <a href={EMAIL_URL} class="cta-btn email">✉️ Email</a>

    <p class="assure">
      <strong>The first answer is always free.</strong> We read every message
      and reply as soon as we can — if we're mid-job, we'll still confirm
      we've seen you and follow up right after.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .contact{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center}
  .eyebrow{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--primary);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;margin-bottom:10px}
  h1{font-size:clamp(26px,4.6vw,38px);line-height:1.15;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em}
  .lede{color:var(--muted);margin:16px 0 30px}
  .prep{list-style:none;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;margin:0 0 34px}
  .prep li{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;border:2px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:16px 18px}
  .prep .num{flex-shrink:0;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--primary);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;font-size:14px}
  .prep strong{display:block;margin-bottom:2px}
  .prep p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
  .cta-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:var(--whatsapp);color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:17px;padding:16px 34px;border-radius:999px;transition:transform .15s,box-shadow .15s}
  .cta-btn.kakao{background:var(--kakao);color:#191919 !important}
  .cta-btn.email{background:var(--email);color:#fff !important}
  .cta-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.12)}
  .assure{margin-top:22px;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
  .assure strong{color:var(--fg)}
</style>
